{"track":"python","category":"함수 만들기 ① 기본","level":1,"title":"세 배 만들기","desc":"<p>수 <code>x</code>의 <b>3배</b>를 돌려주는 함수 <code>triple(x)</code>를 만드세요.</p>","starter":"def triple(x):\n    pass\n","solution":"def triple(x):\n    return x * 3\n","hint":"<p><code>return x * 3</code></p>","tests":[{"call":"triple(3)","expected":9,"visible":true},{"call":"triple(-2)","expected":-6,"visible":true},{"call":"triple(0)","expected":0,"visible":false},{"call":"triple(1.5)","expected":4.5,"visible":false}],"id":"py-295"}